  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p>Anoche se inugur&oacute;, en un gran ambiente, L&#39;Aixopluc, junto a las piscinas municipales de Suera, la que se puede considerar la terraza de verano de la Sierra Espad&aacute;n.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/06/IMG_1157.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Animaron la noche el dj Campos y una actuaci&oacute;n a cargo del m&uacute;sico local Alberto Mart&iacute; Navarro quien, con su flauta travesera, desgran&oacute; melod&iacute;as que destacaban sobre la m&uacute;sica enlatada de ordenador que le acompa&ntilde;aba, y se complementaban perfectamente.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauglaixoplucsuera/img_1134.jpg\" alt=\"img_1134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauglaixoplucsuera/img_1135.jpg\" alt=\"img_1135\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauglaixoplucsuera/img_1136.jpg\" alt=\"img_1136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauglaixoplucsuera/img_1137.jpg\" alt=\"img_1137\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauglaixoplucsuera/img_1138.jpg\" alt=\"img_1138\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauglaixoplucsuera/img_1139.jpg\" alt=\"img_1139\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauglaixoplucsuera/img_1140.jpg\" alt=\"img_1140\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauglaixoplucsuera/img_1141.jpg\" alt=\"img_1141\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"http